WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Upload a CSV or connect Google Sheets to Naxely.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Naxely detects your columns and selects the right chart types automatically.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:20.000
